Prior findings rechecked:
- CR-001: standalone phases 5-10 now mirror current Studio lifecycle policy and precede pipeline/runtime construction.
- CR-002: launch get/list use an existing read-only SQLite handle; Save owns table creation; Reset opens only existing state.

New shared-contract regression correlation:
- ApplicationPlatformStateStore.withExistingDatabase now opens DatabaseSync with readOnly:true.
- ApplicationExecutionEventJournalStore.getNextPendingRecordIfPresent calls readNextPendingRecord.
- readNextPendingRecord calls ensureTables, including INSERT OR IGNORE into the dispatch cursor.
- ApplicationPlatformLifecycle.recoverAfterListen calls resumePendingEventsForApplication for every ready application.
- That service calls getNextPendingRecordIfPresent; a supported same-data restart reaches the read-only write attempt.

